l-fated hike into the mysterious yet beautiful Black Forest, the backdrop of many myths and legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274320/extras/b80559941eb22b01a0b904c30d1dc867.poster.avif?t=1780392540\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274320/extras/b80559941eb22b01a0b904c30d1dc867.webm?t=1780392540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274320/extras/b80559941eb22b01a0b904c30d1dc867.mp4?t=1780392540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR DECISIONS MATTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will survive? Help the protagonists stay alive during their horrific journey through the woods. Try not to get corrupted and fall prey to the dark powers lurking inside the forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274320/extras/02b5821587c1bc4b79af751ce0a65ee8.poster.avif?t=1780392540\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274320/extras/02b5821587c1bc4b79af751ce0a65ee8.webm?t=1780392540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274320/extras/02b5821587c1bc4b79af751ce0a65ee8.mp4?t=1780392540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLE POVs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of multiple characters as the POV switches throughout the game for you to shape the story through their eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared